// expect: same: n,sev,m = 547|16|The INSERT statement conflicted with the assertion "sal_pos". The conflict occurred in database "lexdb", table "dbo.emp".
// expect: same: error 547 (16): The INSERT statement conflicted with the assertion "sal_pos". The conflict occurred in database "lexdb", table "dbo.emp". // tc,n = 0|2 // ok
// expect: same: error 547 (16): The INSERT statement conflicted with the assertion "log_pos". The conflict occurred in database "lexdb", table "dbo.logt". // n = 0
// expect: same: (2) / (2) // n = 2 // (2)
// expect: same: error 547 (16): The INSERT statement conflicted with the assertion "log_pos". The conflict occurred in database "lexdb", table "dbo.logt". // n = 0
// expect: same: (2) // n = 2 // (2)
// expect: same: error 547 (16): The INSERT statement conflicted with the assertion "log_pos". The conflict occurred in database "lexdb", table "dbo.logt". // sal = 50 // n = 0
